# The synthetic DICOM fixtures are committed (all PHI-free, generated by generate.cjs), so a
# fresh checkout — a CI or cloud agent — can run the E2E suite without generating them.
# Regenerate with `node e2e/fixtures/dicom/generate.cjs [name]` after changing the generator.
#
# Except the perf fixture: ~150 MB, used only by the perf harness, which generates it
# (`npm run test:perf`).
